        "native_id": "bsc37kr8hgnm",
        "status": "investigating",
        "body": "Cloudflare is aware that deploying Workers that the nodejs_compat compatibility flag and a compatibility date on or after 2026-08-04 is being disallowed. This is impacting Workers and Workers for Platforms.\n\nWe are working on relaxing this assertion. To avoid this error, remove the nodejs_compat compatibility flag from your Worker.",
